{"version":1,"key":"card:562","content":{"id":562,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"54c77cf5-8ff9-4455-a17c-225abbbccc12","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"TCP 为什么要进行三次握手？为什么不是两次？为什么不是四次？"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65a92a6f-834d-4f61-8540-bee632267af2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"首先要明白进行握手的目的：确认双方的发送和接收信息的能力是 OK 的，即信道是可靠的"}]},{"type":"mermaid","tauContract":"1c918d7603a3e3ecd29f011e4bab52bce848fe941bcb9a9dcf18f1024e918a5d","chart":"sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant Server\n    Client->>Server: SYN (Seq=x)\n    Server->>Client: SYN-ACK (Seq=y, Ack=x+1)\n    Client->>Server: ACK (Ack=y+1)\n    Note over Client,Server: 连接建立成功","collabId":"208ab344-aca1-4ce6-acd9-4bad78e4cc45","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"11734c2c-5c4a-4e79-becd-b74f6fc1b1fb","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"a3e6d2ea-c454-4f15-9755-faa21341d99c","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dac9d0c2-5b8a-4280-aaf5-4fce9e3f921e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第一次握手，Server 能确定 Client 的发送能力和自身的接收能力是 OK 的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"d60aaab3-0b6f-4290-b297-9343b4c911d0","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"65a3cfed-dfc6-4cf4-98aa-6e1ee598af29","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第二次握手，能进行到第二次握手，说明第一次握手成功了，说明 Client 的发送能力和 Server 的接收能力是 OK 的，而收到第二握手，能证明 Client 的接收能力和 Server 的发送能力是 OK，这个时候 Client 已经明白二者的收发能力都是 OK 的"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"74a8b974-c0e6-4e85-bcb3-51af3fe639ee","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c5230703-0498-47e1-81da-c87baf623ab4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"第三次握手，说明第二次握手成功了，Server 知道自身的发送和 Client 的接收能力是 OK 的，此时 Server 二者的收发能力是 OK 的"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"64944875-1fde-403f-817e-b043d2f127c7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所以为什么是三次，因为三次握手才能让双方都明白二者的收发能力是 OK 的，两次太少，而四次太多，三次就足够的。"}]}],"tags":["计算机网络/TCP","面试题"],"createTime":1744249368201,"updateTime":1744619926764,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1744619926764}}